From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: solarus-mister build <build@solarus-mister.local>
Date: Wed, 5 Aug 2026 18:45:18 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/6] feat(mister/2.x): MainLoop root-surface tag, OSD restart
 + FPS pump, draw-phase profiling; Video SW-3 skip-screen-blit

---
 src/core/MainLoop.cpp  | 126 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 src/graphics/Video.cpp |  44 +++++++++++++-
 2 files changed, 167 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/core/MainLoop.cpp b/src/core/MainLoop.cpp
index 328ebf5..0aebb23 100644
--- a/src/core/MainLoop.cpp
+++ b/src/core/MainLoop.cpp
@@ -14,6 +14,7 @@
